WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.955
These assessment tasks bring the main ideas together
One task asks

00:00:05.981 --> 00:00:09.876
for sales revenue and unique products by category
with a group threshold

00:00:10.813 --> 00:00:14.970
Another asks for Fall twenty twenty-four course
averages but only for courses

00:00:14.997 --> 00:00:20.260
with enough students A third asks for separate
diagnosis counts by patient

00:00:21.181 --> 00:00:25.431
The final task asks for employee detail with
department and company averages

00:00:27.183 --> 00:00:31.406
Before writing any query identify the grain and the
type of calculation

00:00:33.163 --> 00:00:36.676
Ask whether you need grouped rows or detail rows
whether the filter

00:00:36.702 --> 00:00:40.873
is on source rows or completed groups and whether
conditional aggregation or

00:00:40.899 --> 00:00:46.639
a window function fits the requirement The coding
exercises that follow break

00:00:46.665 --> 00:00:50.454
these ideas into smaller pieces so you can practice
them independently
